#
# Pins act's runner image so `act` (Story 1.1 Task 4 CI verification, run
# inside the devcontainer) doesn't hit an interactive image-size picker on
# first run. Medium: best default action compatibility without the ~17GB
# "Large" image's disk footprint.
-P ubuntu-latest=catthehacker/ubuntu:act-latest
# This workflow's steps never need Docker themselves; disable act's default
# bind-mount of the docker socket into job containers (it otherwise tries to
# re-mount our own forwarded host socket inside the nested job container,
# which fails under this host's rootless-Podman setup).
--container-daemon-socket -
